          "box": {
           "w": 584,
           "h": 424,
           "y": 1118
          },
          "html": "A new roof is a major investment, and roofing emergencies rarely happen at a convenient time. Whether you are facing sudden storm damage, need a total commercial roof replacement, or simply want to upgrade your home’s curb appeal with premium materials like standing seam metal or F-Wave synthetic shingles, capital shouldn't be a roadblock.<br><br>At Core Four Roofing, we believe that every Texas family and business deserves a safe, reliable roof over their heads. That is why we have partnered with the nation’s top home improvement lenders to provide customized financing plans. Our application process is completely secure, paperless, and incredibly fast, allowing you to secure funding and schedule your roof installation without draining your savings account or business operating capital.",
