          "items": [
           {
            "q": "Does applying for financing affect my credit score?",
            "a": "In most cases, our lending partners can perform a 'soft pull' on your credit to pre-qualify you and show you your available options without impacting your credit score. A hard inquiry is typically only required once you finalize the loan documents."
           },
           {
            "q": "Can I finance an insurance deductible?",
            "a": "Texas law (HB2102) requires homeowners to pay their insurance deductibles out of pocket. However, you can absolutely use our financing options to cover the cost of your deductible, as well as any premium material upgrades you want to add to your insurance claim."
           },
           {
            "q": "Can I pay off my roofing loan early?",
            "a": "Yes! The vast majority of the financing plans we offer come with absolutely no prepayment penalties. You can pay off your roof at any time without incurring extra fees."
           },
           {
            "q": "Do you offer financing for commercial roofing projects?",
            "a": "Yes. We work with property managers, HOA boards, and building owners to provide commercial financing and phased CapEx solutions. Contact our commercial team directly to discuss large-scale funding options."
           }
          ]
         },
